  "html": "<div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Unser E-Wurf ist bereits wieder ein Jahr alt</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">19.11.2018</p>\n<hr class=\"fx-sep\"><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"/uploads/2018/11/E-Ebony-205x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"/uploads/2018/11/E-Epikur-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"/uploads/2018/11/E-Empress-300x220.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"220\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"/uploads/2018/11/E-Neo-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"/uploads/2018/11/E-Egon-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"/uploads/2018/11/E-Estella-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Luan Umbra Fida</h4>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/10/Foto-Luan.jpg\" alt=\"Luan\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Lilith</h4>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/10/Lilith-Foto.jpg\" alt=\"Lilith\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><div class=\"fx-title\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Lilith hat am 19. November 2017 ihre  Welpen geworfen !</h4></div></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/lilith_nach_wurf-e1511980194759.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"218\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><p style=\"text-align: left\">Lilith wurde am 20. September erfolgreich von Leon Umbra Fida gedeckt.<br>\nWir hoffen auf gesunde und flat-typische Welpen um den 20. November.<br>\nAus dieser Verpaarung erwarten wir besonders arbeitsfreudige Flats,<br>\nda beide Eltern schon mehrmals mit „Judges Choice“ bei den Working<br>\nTests ausgezeichnet wurden.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Lilith hat am 19. November ihre  Welpen geworfen<br>\n– 5 Hündinnen und 4 Rüden<br>\n</strong><strong> mit einem Durchschnittsgewicht von 350 g. Alles bestens!</strong></p>\n</div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><hr class=\"fx-sep\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unsere Welpen in den ersten 2 Wochen</strong></h2>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img zoom\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/E-Wurf-221117_1-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img zoom\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"/uploads/2017/09/E-Wurf-221117_2-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"f